==Battleground==
*1 [[Large White Ball]] (100%) spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Large White Ball]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large White Ball]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

